# MaCSad admin application

Import AdminPolicy from "./admin_policy.lg".
Import AdminShell from "./admin_shell.lg".

The application root binds the tested board policy to the presentation shell.
Policy decisions stay in their import-free leaves; the shell only renders them.

## Component MacsAdAdmin
State:
    Let columnCount be kanbanColumnCount().
    Let closedWorkAccepted be closedAcceptsOrdinaryWork(false).
View:
    <AdminShell columnCount={columnCount} closedWorkAccepted={closedWorkAccepted}/>
